                                "sense_id": "98e94733-387e-3343-b36a-50cd736d68ac",
                                "text": "It is also his considered opinion that a condition precedent to any legislative action is that those best qualified to pronounce on the merits of a popular demand examine it in all its aspects. That is good Menzian legalese, as pompous as parody permits."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
